  "icon": "🏪",
  "description": "Our gated community is private and family-friendly and only 1.5 miles away from the beautiful white sand beaches! Our Resort is restricted to Class-A coaches only. Coaches must be 15 years old or newer. Terry Cove Motor Coach Resort features immaculate grounds with wide brick paver streets, 2 pools, a clubhouse, and miles of trails nearby. All lots are spacious 40' x 70' with 21' wide paved parking pads and 12' x 18' screened gazebos. Whether you're an owner or a guest, you'll enjoy the spacious oversized lots at Terry Cove RV Resort. We offer both pull-through lots and back-in lots, all the same size and all featuring great outdoor living space. All lots are spacious enough to handle BIG RIGS, AWNINGS, SLIDES and OUTDOOR FURNITURE. The beach is 5 minutes by car, 12 minutes by golf cart, or a short bike ride on paved sidewalks. Staying at the beach has never been so affordable. If you are looking to buy, our lots start out at $140k. And you can rent many of our lots for a fraction of the cost of a condo!",
